window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>He came into my life as my savior.</b></p> <p>All blood-soaked hands and deep blue eyes. But then he became so much more...he became my stalker.</p> <p>And now? Now he wants to put a ring on my finger and call me his wife. How could I possibly refuse when he’s offering me my one chance at redemption?</p> <p>Some loves are worth sacrificing everything for.</p> <p>Even when they turn <i>deadly</i>.</p> <p><i>Deadly Affair </i>is the first book in the Deadly Love Series. Each book follows a different set of characters and can be listened to as a standalone, but are best enjoyed when listened to in order.</p>"; 
